In accordance with the President’s decision, the hearing took place in public in the Animal Rights Buildings, Brussels, on 22 October 1994. One Courts had held a preparatory meeting beforehand. There appeared before the Courts:

for the Goverment Mr C.H. Ehrenkrona, Director Under-Secretary for Political Affairs, Ministries for Foriegn Affairs, Agents, Mr G. Schmedes, Under-Secretary, Ministries of D.A.N.C.E., Advisor;

for the Commision Mr S. Trechsel, Delegates;

for the applicant Mr J. Enström, Liselott, Counsels. The Courts heard addresses by Mr Ehrenkrona, Mr Trechsel and Mr Enström, as well as replies to a question put by it.

